abstract: "LOAD-SPAN is a dynamic load redistribution analysis and structural stability assessment framework for long-span systems, grounded in classical structural mechanics, fracture mechanics, and reliability engineering, with an AI-assisted analytical support layer operating under strict physical constraints."
